  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* fix(search): fixed a bug that caused results to reshuffle during search.\r\n* other(search): xplr search will default to the default skim algorithm.\r\n\r\n## Others:\r\n* deps: upgraded dependencies.\r\n* docs: fix nonexistent util function in upgrade guide by @latent-9 in https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/pull/777\r\n* ubuntu(snap): @mikoloism helped fix Ubuntu snap build.\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @latent-9 made their first contribution in https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/pull/777\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/compare/v1.1.0...v1.1.1",
